      "settings": {
        "sticker": "Poured by hand",
        "reverse": false,
        "background": "none",
        "eyebrow": "Our story",
        "heading": "Behind every candle, <em>a pair of hands</em>",
        "text": "<p>Noon began at a kitchen table with one pot of wax and a lot of patience. Our mark is the Arabic letter <strong>ن</strong> (noon) — its dot became our flame.</p><p>Every candle is still poured, shaped and finished by hand, which is why each one is a little different from the last.</p>",
        "button_label": "Read our story",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/noon-candle-glow-night.jpg"
      }
    },
    "process": {
      "type": "process",
      "blocks": {
        "p1": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Melt & colour",
            "text": "Soy wax is melted slowly and tinted by hand in small batches."
          }
        },
        "p2": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scent & pour",
            "text": "Premium, phthalate-free fragrance oils are blended in, then poured into glass or moulds."
          }
        },
        "p3": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Cure & finish",
            "text": "Each candle cures for days before it is decorated, trimmed and checked by hand."
          }
        },
        "p4": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Wrap & send",
            "text": "Packed gift-ready with a care card, so it arrives looking as good as it left."
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "p1",
        "p2",
        "p3",
        "p4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "background": "cream",
        "eyebrow": "How it's made",
        "heading": "Slow-made, <em>on purpose</em>",
        "text": "<p>It takes longer this way — and that's the point. Two candles from the same batch are never quite identical. That's what handmade looks like.</p>"
      }
    },
